   "score": 11,
   "created_utc": "2013-07-02T12:34:44Z",
   "edited": false,
   "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
   "body_html": "By the way, you would have expected your output to be 5, not 4: <code>*ptr</code> points to the first element of the array, which is 1, four elements after it you have 5. 5 would have been the output if you had defined <code>int *ptr = (int *) arr;</code>"
